      "a": "Deloitte Consulting has $2B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. The firm has 534 awards this fiscal year to date and an average award size of $3.7M. Obligations are down 32.9% year over year and the FY26 total is lower than FY25 and FY24."
    },
    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Deloitte Consulting?",
